# Troubleshooting Notes

## Preview Window Error

```text
Preview window unavailable
```

Cause:

- SSH session
- No local display attached

Not a camera fault.

---

## HTTP Server Appeared Frozen

Cause:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

takes over the terminal.

Resolution:

```text
Ctrl+C
```

or

```bash
pkill -f http.server
```

---

## Motion Package Failure

Errors:

```text
VIDIOC_STREAMON: Invalid argument
```

```text
V4L2 device failed to open
```

Cause:

Bookworm/libcamera compatibility issues.

Resolution:

Switch to Picamera2 and OpenCV.

---

## Nano Editing on Mobile

Issue:

Python script formatting corrupted while editing via phone.

Resolution:

Create files using:

```bash
cat <<EOF
...
EOF
```

instead of nano when working from Android.

